# Game-master / world-manipulator model variant.
#
# Same weights as qwen3.6:27b, but with a large context window baked in so the
# GM can hold world state, history, and many entities at once — INDEPENDENT of
# the global OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH (which is the small, fast default for NPC
# dialogue). Ollama's OpenAI /v1 endpoint ignores per-request num_ctx, so the
# only clean way to give one role a bigger window is a model variant like this.
#
# Build:  ollama create loom-gm -f ops/modelfiles/loom-gm.Modelfile
# Use:    point the GM provider at model "loom-gm" (Phase 3).
#
# VRAM note: context is expensive (KV cache grows with num_ctx). 32K on a 27B
# takes a large slice of one 48GB card. Lower num_ctx or set
# OLLAMA_KV_CACHE_TYPE=q8_0 on the service if it gets tight.
FROM qwen3.6:27b
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
